OL,3,AKing acknowledges 'suffering of the
OL,4,Apast' as Caribbean tour begins
OL,5,
OL,6,FKing Charles has arrived in the Bahamas
OL,7,Ffor a nine-day tour of the Caribbean -
OL,8,Fthe first time he has visited the
OL,9,Fregion as monarch.
OL,11,FThe King, wearing sunglasses and a grey
OL,12,Fsuit, was given a ceremonial welcome at
OL,13,Fthe airport before attending a youth
OL,14,Frally.
OL,23,APub: 27-OctQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
OL,24,ANext PageB Nat NewsC Nat TVF Clean Feed
FL,304,300,200,140,0,100
